#. いや、植物庭園で見つけた死体は、
#. 間違いなく、<CLT 3>戦刃むくろ<CLT>だったはずだよ。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"No, the body we found in the garden was <CLT 3>Mukuro<CLT>,\n"
"that's one thing we can be sure of."
msgstr ""

#. だって、あの<CLT 3>死体の特徴<CLT>は、
#. 戦刃むくろのプロフィールとも一致してたんだ。
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The body's <CLT 3>appearance and measurements<CLT> are\n"
"consistent with her records."
msgstr ""

#. …そうだよね、霧切さん？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Right, Kyoko?"
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろの身長は１６９センチ、体重は４４キロ。
#. スリーサイズは８０・５５・８２…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"She was 5 foot 6 inches tall and weighed 97 pounds.\n"
"Her vitals were 31-21-32."
msgstr ""

#. …すべて、あの死体と一致していたわね。
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Everything in her profile is consistent with that\n"
"corpse."
msgstr ""

#. それに、フェンリルのタトゥーの件もあるし…
#. やっぱり、あの死体は戦刃むくろだったんだよ。
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And then there's the matter of the Fenrir tattoo. So\n"
"there's no question it's her."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも…戦刃むくろじゃないとなると…
#. じゃあ…実は生きてるのって…
msgctxt "0007 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"B-But...if Mukuro's not the mastermind, then...who's\n"
"actually still alive...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死んだと見せかけているけど、
#. 本当は生きている人物…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Someone's made it look like they died, but they're\n"
"actually still alive...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>残る可能性は…あの人しかいないはずだ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's only one person it could be...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なに…？
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. ななな、苗木ッ！
#. 白夜様になんて態度を！？
msgctxt "0011 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "H-H-H-How dare you!? Master is in no mood!"
msgstr ""

#. …黒幕は死んだと見せかけて、
#. 本当は生きている人物だろう…
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The mastermind is still alive, yes, but they also made\n"
"it look like they'd *died*."
msgstr ""

#. 戯れもいい加減にしろ…
msgctxt "0013 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Enough fooling around..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. へ…？
msgctxt "0015 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. な、なななななっ！
#. 俺は…実は死んでたんだべか…？
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "W-W-W-W-Was I actually dead this whole time!?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうか…俺はついに肉という器を脱ぎ捨て、
#. 人の更なる上位へと昇華したんだな…！
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I see... I've finally cast off my fleshy vessel and\n"
"sublimated to a higher plane!"
msgstr ""

#. さあ、オメーら！
#. 俺を崇めろ！　奉れ！　敬え！
msgctxt "0018 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Worship me! All of you! Worship me and bring me gifts!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君…
#. 余計な事をしないで…
msgctxt "0019 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Makoto...please don't encourage him."
msgstr ""

#. ご、ごめん…
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "S-Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0022 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. き、霧切っちが！？
#. ややややや、やっぱり幽霊なんか？
msgctxt "0023 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Kyoko!? So she really is a gh-gh-gh-ghost!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君…なんのつもりか知らないけど、
#. 真面目にやって…
msgctxt "0024 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I don't know what you're playing at, Makoto, but\n"
"please take this seriously."
msgstr ""

#. ご、ごめん…
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "S-Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. え、えぇぇぇ！？
msgctxt "0027 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Whaaaat!?"
msgstr ""

#. 私の訳ないじゃん！
#. ちゃんと生きてるし！
msgctxt "0028 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "It's not me! I've been alive this whole time!"
msgstr ""

#. …黒幕は死んだと見せかけて、
#. 本当は生きている人物よ。
msgctxt "0029 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The mastermind is still alive. But they'd also\n"
"convinced us they were dead."
msgstr ""

#. それは、もう間違いないわ…
msgctxt "0030 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So I don't think there's any question..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. は…？
msgctxt "0032 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そうよね…わかってるわよ…
#. あたしみたいなブスは…
msgctxt "0033 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I know wh-what you're saying. Someone as ugly as\n"
"m-me..."
msgstr ""

#. 生きていても死んでるみたいなものよね…
#. アハハ、アハッ、ヒッ…アヒヒヒ…！
msgctxt "0034 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Even though I'm a-alive, I look like a corpse...\n"
"Ahaha... Ahahihihueheho...!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木、話をややこしくするな…
#. お前は、すでにわかっているんだろう…？
msgctxt "0035 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Don't make things more complicated than they need to\n"
"be. You already know that's wrong..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. いや、待て…
#. 本当にこの人でいいのか…？
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wait, hold on... Am I really sure about this?"
msgstr ""

#. もう一度、よく考えてみよう…
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'd better think about it one more time..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. どうした、苗木…
msgctxt "0040 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What's wrong, Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. 時間を無駄にしている場合ではない。
#. 早く指摘しろ…
msgctxt "0041 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We can't afford to waste time now. Hurry up and answer\n"
"us..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>江ノ島盾子<CLT>…生きているのは彼女の方だ。
#. そうとしか考えられないよ！
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "<CLT 3>Junko<CLT> is still alive. It's the only possibility!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0044 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 本当にそうなのか…？
msgctxt "0045 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Are you sure about that?"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、戦刃むくろが死んでいる以上、
#. 他に可能性があるのは、江ノ島盾子だけだろう…
msgctxt "0047 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I admit, since Mukuro is undoubtedly dead, Junko does\n"
"seem to be the only other explanation."
msgstr ""

#. だが、江ノ島盾子は、
#. 俺達の目の前で、槍に貫かれて死んだはず…
msgctxt "0048 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But we saw her get impaled. She died right before our\n"
"very eyes..."
msgstr ""

#. 江ノ島盾子が生きているとなると、
#. あの死は<CLT 3>“演技”<CLT>だったという事になるが…
msgctxt "0049 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If Junko were still alive, the death we saw would had\n"
"to have been some kind of <CLT 3>charade<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 江ノ島盾子の死は、
#. お前自身も確認していたはずだぞ？
msgctxt "0050 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "But you yourself confirmed she was dead, did you not?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言えば…
#. あの時、ボクは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Now that you mention it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは、江ノ島さんの死体にそっと手を触れてみた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I gently placed my hand on Junko's lifeless body...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>映画やドラマで見るように、
#. 彼女の手や首の脈を確かめてみたのだが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I touched her wrist to check for a pulse, like they do\n"
"in movies and stuff, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 本当に…死んでる……
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "She...really is dead."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それ以上は一切の言い表しようもないほど…
#. 彼女は完全に死んでいた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There wasn't anything else to say. She was gone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの時、ボクは確認している。彼女の死を…
#. つまり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I did check, absolutely. And I can say for sure...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 江ノ島さんは死んでいたんだ…
#. 間違いなく…死んでいたんだ…
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "She was dead. There's no question...Junko was dead."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…江ノ島ちゃんが生きてるって言うのは…？
msgctxt "0059 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "So...the idea that she's still alive..."
msgstr ""

#. 間違ってる…のかも……
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It must be...wrong."
msgstr ""

#. 早くも…前言撤回…！？
msgctxt "0061 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Th-Then you're withdrawing your p-previous\n"
"statement...!?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷ…うぷぷぷ…！
msgctxt "0062 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhu... Puhuhu!"
msgstr ""

#. せっかく頑張ったのに、お気の毒でしたー！
#. 苗木クンの推理は不正解だったみたいだね！！
msgctxt "0063 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I know you gave it your best shot, but too bad! I\n"
"guess your conclusion was a dud!"
msgstr ""

#. アーッハッハッハ！　残念でしたー！！
msgctxt "0064 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Ahahaha! Too bad, too bad!"
msgstr ""

#. まだ…そう決まった訳じゃないわよ。
msgctxt "0065 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "This case hasn't been decided just yet..."
msgstr ""

#. へ…？
msgctxt "0066 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Oh...?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君も…まだ諦めた訳じゃないでしょう？
msgctxt "0067 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You haven't given up already, have you Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…え？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...Huh?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. も、もちろんだよ…！
#. 諦める訳ないじゃないか…！
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"N-No, of course not! There's no way I'd give up that\n"
"easy!"
msgstr ""

#. 諦めないのは結構だが、
#. この問題には、どう片を付けるつもりだ？
msgctxt "0070 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That's all well and good, but how do you intend to\n"
"solve the problem standing in your way?"
msgstr ""

#. 江ノ島は間違いなく死んでいた。
#. そして、戦刃むくろも間違いなく死んでいたとなると…
msgctxt "0071 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Junko absolutely died. Mukuro absolutely died."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、どっちも死んでるって事だべ！？
#. 生き残りなんていねーって話だべ！
msgctxt "0072 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Then both of them are dead, right!? There can't be any\n"
"kind of survivor story!"
msgstr ""

#. だったら、逆に考えてみたらどうかしら？
msgctxt "0073 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I think we need to look at this from the opposite\n"
"direction."
msgstr ""

#. え？　逆って？
msgctxt "0074 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh? The opposite direction...?"
msgstr ""

#. もし、江ノ島盾子が生きているとしたら、
#. 彼女はどうやって生き残ったのか…
msgctxt "0075 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Let's assume Junko is still alive. If so, how could\n"
"she have survived?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>江ノ島盾子は…どうやって生き残ったのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How could Junko have survived...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの時、ボクはちゃんと確認しているんだ。
#. 彼女が間違いなく死んでいる事を…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I checked her. She was dead, I'm sure of it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それでも、彼女が生きているとしたら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But still...if she *were* alive somehow...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
